     4672     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('sys-time'    , 'Время изменения', 'time', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     4673     run fltfield-add in this-procedure('who'         , 'Кто', 'usr', input-output fld, input-output lab, input-output spr, input-output dim)  no-error.
     4674   Filter-Block:
